          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 八肽的氨基酸组成为 Asp, Ser, Gly, Ala, Met, Phe 和 Lys。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.106,
            0.849,
            0.196
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.154,
                0.106,
                0.467,
                0.12
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①FDNB 与之反应再酸水解得 DNP-Ala。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.124,
                0.849,
                0.158
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "②胰凝乳蛋白酶消化后分出一个四肽，其组成为 Asp, Gly, Lys 和 Met，此四肽与 FDNB 反应生成 DNP-Gly。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.161,
                0.84,
                0.196
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③胰蛋白酶消化八肽后得到组成为 Lys，Ala，Ser 及 Phe，Lys，Gly 两个三肽及一个二肽，此二肽被 CNBr 处理游离出 Asp。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.198,
            0.439,
            0.213
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "请写出八肽顺序及推知过程。(6分)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
